and switch motions to watch them move.\n\nIncluded characters (7 total):\n- Monsters series: Gnome / Cyclops / Evil Knight / Golem / Mummy / Goblin / Orc\n\nFeatures:\n- Life size: Walk around full-scale characters and inspect them up close\n- 16 motions: Stand, Walk, Run, Battle Attack and more. Characters with weapons draw and sheathe them with Battle In / Out\n- Head look: Characters turn to look at you as you approach\n- VR and AR: Switch between a virtual stage and the real world around you\n- AR display: Lighting that matches your surroundings (Auto Lighting), shadows on the floor (AR Floor), and characters hidden behind real objects (AR Occlusion)\n- Three head variations for Goblin\n- Choose from three appear / disappear effects\n- Open each character's introduction page and video\n- Adjust turning, volume and more in Options\n\nNote: AR Occlusion is supported on Meta Quest 3 / 3S only.", "short_description": "Experience each character in VR and AR. A viewer for CatStudio's 3D character assets: see them life-size and up close in VR, or bring them into the world around you in AR."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.catstudio.jp/privacypolicy_quest.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "CatStudio LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.catstudio.jp/xr_charactercatalog_en.html", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tra